// The live medium's compositor defaults. Not copied to the installed system.
//
// "auto" picks the lightest graphics profile this PC needs when abyss starts:
// software rendering, a virtual GPU, little RAM or an old integrated GPU gets
// "minimal" or "low"; capable hardware keeps the full glass look. The choice is
// made again on every start and never written to a file. A key a user writes in
// ~/.config/eclipse/abyss.kdl still wins over the profile. See D-03 section 5.1.
decoration {
    profile "auto"
}
